A case was created because your customer has raised an issue in the Customer Excellence Survey.

Case Number:{!Case.CaseNumber}
Contact Name:{!Case.00No000000DVoQ2}
Account:{!Case.00No000000DVoPz}
Reason:{!Case.Subject}
Case Opened:{!Case.CreatedDate}
Case last modified on:{!Case.LastModifiedDate}

Steps to be taken:

1. Click Hereto open the case and view responses from your customer. Please note that cases can be created for more than one reason. Review the CEP responses section of the case for a summary of the key indicator scores (Delight, Velocity, Account Management, Partnership, Technical Expertise or Operations Support).

2. Make customer contact within 3 business days to gather more information. Update case status appropriately and add notes from discussion.

3. Within 10 business days, document your Action Plan in the internal comments. Please note that all low key indicator scores should be addressed in the Action Plan. Be sure to include the following:

a. Restatement of Customer Issue

b. Document Measurable Action Plan

c. Expected Delivery Date

Click Herefor additional training on how to process your case.



